{"about_the_game":"<strong>Keep the Balance! is a fast-paced puzzle game requiring basic math skills. </strong><br><br>An evil joker has invaded our world and tries to disturb The Magic Scales that balance our world, in order to unleash the forces of Chaos. Each level has a monkey standing on top of the scales. You have to keep the equilibrium by launching objects, passing below on a conveyor, onto the scales. All locations have unique sets of objects to which weight, shown as a number, has been assigned. As the objects appear from both sides of the screen at the same time, you move the cursor below an object and press a key to launch it. At the top of each scale, the current weight is shown. If there is a big gap in weight, the monkey will slowly slide to the heaviest side. <br><br>When it falls down, the game is over...","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1260930?t=1593010487","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1260930?t=1593010487","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1260930/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1593010487","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1260930/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1593010487","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<strong>Keep the Balance! is a fast-paced puzzle game requiring basic math skills. </strong><br><br>An evil joker has invaded our world and tries to disturb The Magic Scales that balance our world, in order to unleash the forces of Chaos. Each level has a monkey standing on top of the scales. You have to keep the equilibrium by launching objects, passing below on a conveyor, onto the scales. All locations have unique sets of objects to which weight, shown as a number, has been assigned. As the